(7400062, 1164771, 71489, '<td valign="top">With the bombardment of cliched morning long exposures and predictable attempts at this challenge, I really hope this makes at least a front page if not a ribbon. Very very morningy, the drops on the window give such a cool feel and absolutely brilliant focus on your pups eyes. I love it through and through.<br/>10. And a favourite.</td>', 'With the bombardment of cliched morning long exposures and predictable attempts at this challenge, I really hope this makes at least a front page if not a ribbon. Very very morningy, the drops on the window give such a cool feel and absolutely brilliant focus on your pups eyes. I love it through and through.10. And a favourite.', '2015-08-26 11:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
