(7400624, 1164745, 136989, '<td valign="top">This picture brought back memories of camping trips where we woke to the smell of pine and ate breakfast in the crisp morning, mountain air.  I love how the sunlight filters through the trees and how the shadows pull you in.  If you need me I''ll be seated at the picnic table drinking my coffee.. .  My favorite in this challenge<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This picture brought back memories of camping trips where we woke to the smell of pine and ate breakfast in the crisp morning, mountain air.  I love how the sunlight filters through the trees and how the shadows pull you in.  If you need me I''ll be seated at the picnic table drinking my coffee.. .  My favorite in this challenge', '2015-08-28 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
